	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratiam et pacem a domino.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Mittit per bibliopolam nostrum<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1"><persName ref="p6725">Hans Stuber</persName>; s. <ref target="file12429">Nr. 2382</ref> und Anm. 3.</note>, colende domine, m. <persName ref="p2121">Gabriel<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>In der Vorlage</hi> Grabriel.</note> Meyer</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>quaedam breviter de castro uno atque altero consignata, ut petiisti<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Zu den von <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> gewünschten und von dem <placeName ref="l2">Aarauer</placeName> Stadtschreiber <persName ref="p2121">Gabriel Meyer</persName> niedergeschriebenen Aufzeichnungen über Burgen im <placeName ref="l594">Aargau</placeName> s. <ref target="file12457">Nr. 2410</ref>,1-7 sowie <ref target="file12474">Nr. 2427</ref>,2. 20-23.</note>.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Negotiis occupatus plura nunc non <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>potuit.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Quod si hęc videris et placuerint, et in caeteris suam pollicetur operam.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Haec dat, ut <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>percurras, placeant nec ne, aut si qua desideres in his, signes et ad nos remittas.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Si ita <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>volueris, habebis simili brevitate et de caeteris, quorum nomina in fine his adiunxit.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z6"/>Sin aliter vis tractari, itidem literis significabis.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Caeterum tempore opus erit.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Novit <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>ipse pleraque, sed obiter neque literis ea commendare audet; sed diligentius singula, si <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>volueris, a possessoribus hodiernis inquiret.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="de">Er wil selbs, so es uch gefaelt, uff <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>die schloͤsser gan und alle ding, so vil müglich ist, eigenlich erfaren.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Scribes ergo, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>quod fieri volueris.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Scripsisset ipse ad te, sed se negociis impediri dicebat.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Rogabat, ut <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>in hanc sententiam ad te scriberem; quod non gravatim praestiti.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div2" corresp="regest2">
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Quae dedisti in Genesim,<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Siehe dazu schon <ref target="file12429">Nr. 2382</ref>,14-22; <ref target="file12457">Nr. 2410</ref>, Anm. 1.</note> intra biduum aut triduum, si certus datus fuerit nuncius, tibi restitu<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>am<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>In der Vorlage</hi> restitam.</note>.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Restant pauca quaedam adhuc excerpenda.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div3" corresp="regest3">
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Porro, ut nuper scripsi,<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Siehe <ref target="file12457">Nr. 2410</ref>,8-20.</note> de sermone ad <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>probrum et ignominiam non solum civitatis nostrae<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5"><placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>, <persName ref="p1553">Hochholzers</persName> Heimat.</note>, sed etiam religionis per <persName ref="p20538">Heinrychum <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Lochman</persName> ioco, ut ipse ait, temere nimis (cum multis certo persuasum esset) effuso puto te <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>satis intellexisse.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Nec est, quod putes me tibi retulisse, quae nullius fuerint momenti.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Nimis <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>enim constanter affirmarat additis etiam quibusdam utilitatibus iam inde enatis, <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>licet nunc ioco dictum velit.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Sciunt nunc nostri<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">die <placeName ref="l2">Aarauer</placeName>.</note> futilem fuisse calumniam.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Interim <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>tamen, quantum ego iudicare possum, permultum utilitatis haberet, si senatus vester <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>ad nostros scriberet seque literis excusaret.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Credunt nunc mihi, cum et ipse revocarit.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Sed <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>literis senatus testaretur zelum suum non solum in flagitiis et sceleratis puniendis, sed in<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c">in <hi>fehlt in der Vorlage.</hi></note> <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>falsis etiam rumoribus in huiusmodi rebus de se sparsis redarguendis; praeterea homines <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>huiusmodi nihili posthac non quidvis in buccam effutirent, etsi cogitarent de legum <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>omnisque honestatis destructione, tamen desideria animi non iam quasi factum evulgarent.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Insuper alii admoniti minus huiusmodi rumoribus fidem adhiberent.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Ad alios iam per <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>nostros pro certissimo sparsum tam scio quam qui certissime.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Haec non eo <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>scribo, quod vel te vel consulem<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7"><persName ref="p1888">Hans Rudolf Lavater</persName>.</note> prudentissimum et honestissimum haec non cogitare putem, <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>sed quod et me patrię famam tueri, ignominiam et opprobrium pro virili avertere <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>decet, et quod nonnullorum hominum, filiorum Belial<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Joh 8, 44</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>2Kor 6, 15</ref></cit>.</note>, ingenium sciam, quibus volupe<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">= volup.</note> est <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>huiusmodi spargere.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Quare rogo, eo, quo ego hęc scribo, animo<pb type="edition" next="347"/> haec accipias <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>et, quod tibi consultissimum fore visum fuerit, facias meque tibi commendatum habeas.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div4" corresp="regest4">
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z32"/>Ex <placeName ref="l41">Berna</placeName> hodie allata est ad nos cantilena per studiosum quendam <placeName ref="l41">Bernensem</placeName><note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10"><persName ref="p7178">Peter Zeller</persName>. Das von ihm verfasste Lied (s. dazu auch <ref target="file12474">Nr. 2427</ref>,3-8) zur Rechtfertigung der lutherischen Abendmahlslehre gegen die Vertreter der zwinglischen Auffassung (s. auch unten Z. 40-44) und die darauffolgende Denunziation beim <placeName ref="l41">Berner</placeName> Rat durch den Mitschüler <persName ref="p4436">Ismael Buchser</persName> führten schließlich im Zeitraum von November 1546 bis Anfang Februar 1547 zu <persName ref="p7178">Zellers</persName> Verweis aus der Schule, zur Inhaftierung von dreizehn als Anhänger <persName ref="p1974">Luthers</persName> befundenen Mitschülern sowie zur Ausweisung von <persName ref="p5047">Thomas Grynäus</persName> aus <placeName ref="l41">Bern</placeName>; s. Adolf <hi>Fluri,</hi> Die <placeName ref="l41">bernische</placeName> Schulordnung von 1548, in: Mitteilungen der Gesellschaft für deutsche Erziehungs- und Schulgeschichte 11, 1901, 191-195; Carl Bernhard <hi>Hundeshagen,</hi> Das Partheiwesen in der Bernischen Landeskirche von 1532 bis 1558, in: Beiträge zur Geschichte der Schweizerisch-reformirten Kirche, zunächst derjenigen des Kantons Bern, hg. v. Friedrich Trechsel, Heft 4, Bern 1842, S. 30.</note> <placeName ref="l41">Bernę</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>sub disciplina <persName ref="p5047">Grynei</persName><note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11"><persName ref="p5047">Thomas Grynäus</persName>, einer der Anführer der lutherischen Partei in <placeName ref="l41">Bern</placeName>; s. <bibl source="b18">HBBW XV</bibl> 71, Anm. 3.</note> composita, quę, ut solent isti nugivendę<note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12">=nugivendi.</note>, tractat negotium <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>eucharistię.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Svermeros et diabolicos vocat omnes, qui negant corpus Christi sumi in <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>coena domini, ac <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinorum</placeName> apologiam vel responsionem<note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13">Die "Orthodoxa <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> ecclesiae confessio" gegen <persName ref="p1974">Luthers</persName> "Kurtz bekentnis"; s. dazu <bibl source="b18">HBBW XV</bibl> 66, Anm. 9.</note> citat, licet non nomi<lb xml:id="p1z36"/>net, ita tamen, ut quivis intelligat.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la">Svermeros et insanos eos vocat, qui affirma<lb xml:id="p1z37"/>re audeant articulos fidei omnes se credere, cum ne primum<note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14">den ersten Artikel des Apostolischen Glaubensbekenntnisses.</note> quidem credant, etc.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z38"/>Tanta est excaecatio senatus<note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" n="15">des Rates von <placeName ref="l41">Bern</placeName>.</note>, ut hęc ferat!</s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la">Vide queso, quo tandem deventum sit, <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>ut non peregrini, non exteri, sed nostri, et contemptissimi homines, hęc impune faciant.</s>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z40"/>Tandem eo res cadat, ut fiat persequutio ingens alterutrius partis.</s>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la">Diu enim hęc <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>ferri non possunt, imo deus non feret.</s>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="la">Misissem eam<note xml:id="fn16" type="footnote" n="16">Das von <persName ref="p7178">Zeller</persName> verfasste Lied (cantilena).</note>, non quod novi aliquid, <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>sed ut <persName ref="p1974">Lutherum</persName> ipsum <placeName ref="l41">Bernę</placeName> nunc in vilissimis hominibus vivere videres; sed non <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>potui tam cito rescribere.</s>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="la">Dominus tandem repurgabit aream suam<note xml:id="fn17" type="footnote" n="17">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Lk 3, 17</ref></cit>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="36" xml:lang="la">Is nobiscum <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>agat pro sua larga misericordia!</s>
					<s n="37" xml:lang="la">Amen.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div5" corresp="regest5">
				<p>
					<s n="38" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
					<s n="39" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutat totum domum tuam <lb xml:id="p1z45"/>uxor mea<note xml:id="fn18" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="18"><persName ref="p5976">Agathe, geb. Näf</persName>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="40" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z46"/><placeName ref="l2">Aarovię</placeName>, 13. aprilis 1546.</s>
					<s n="41" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z47"/>Tuę humanitati deditissimus</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="42" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z48"/><persName ref="p1553">Christianus Hochholzer</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="43" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, ecclesię Christi <lb xml:id="p2z3"/><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> ministro primario et <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>fidelissimo, domino suo tanquam <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>patri colendissimo<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>